flowchart LR
    UI[Manager / Game Launcher] --> EV[Structured Event API]
    RH[Runtime Host] --> EV
    BR[Privileged Broker] --> EV
    UP[Update Bootstrap / Recovery Tool] --> EV

    EV --> PR[Privacy classification]
    PR --> UL[User operational NDJSON]
    PR --> ML[Machine operational NDJSON]
    PR --> AU[Protected security audit]
    PR --> ETW[ETW / TraceLogging]

    UL --> DB[Diagnostic Bundle Builder]
    ML --> DB
    AU --> DB
    ETW --> ETL[On-demand ETL]
    ETL --> DB
    WER[WER LocalDumps] --> DMP[Crash dumps]
    DMP --> DB

    DB --> RED[Selection + redaction + validation]
    RED --> EXP[Local export]
    RED --> SUP[Explicit support upload - future/requirements gated]

    CAN[Canonical SQLite / transaction state] -. diagnostic read-only views .-> DB
    DB -. never imports/replays .-> CAN
